Wrocław Transit — third-party notices
=====================================

Parts of src/core are ported to TypeScript from wroclaw-mpk-map
(https://github.com/real-kijmoshi/wroclaw-mpk-map), taken from commit
b11fe19c813029451d69c1abf79de919d676bbcf (2026-09-05), the last revision
published under the MIT License. Later revisions of that project are
proprietary; nothing here is taken from them.

Ported files (each says so in its header):
  src/core/gtfs/catalogue.ts   <- server/src/gtfs/catalogue.js
  src/core/gtfs/archive.ts     <- server/src/gtfs/archive.js
  src/core/lines.ts            <- server/src/lines.js
  src/core/realtime/mpk.ts     <- server/src/vehicles.js (request encodings, normalisation)
  src/core/realtime/open-data.ts <- server/src/open-data.js (normalisation, merge rules)
  src/core/realtime/klosok.ts  <- server/src/klosok/realtime.js (labels, delays)

